<title>USA: Synetic names Anthony Vuolo CFO.</title>
<headline>Synetic names Anthony Vuolo CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ELMWOOD PARK, N.J. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synetic Inc said Tuesday Anthony Vuolo has been appointed vice president and chief finanacial officer, replacing Victor L. Marrero, who is leaving the company for personal reason.</p>
<p>Vuolo has been a vice president - financial analysis since 1994, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
